### Get pre-signed upload URL
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/getUploadUrl?fileName=front.jpg&clientName=TEST HTTP/1.1

###

### Create assets (bulk — SKU with CSV data required)
POST https://aistylingasset.flixstock.com/api/v1/asset/create HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "clientName": "FLIXSTOCK",
    "createWithoutCSVData": true,
    "files": [
        {
            "barcode": "BATMAN",
            "images": [
                { "imagePath": { "key": "test/batmanCape.jpg", "host": "metamodels-ai" } }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

###

### Create assets (bypass CSV data check)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/create HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "clientName": "TEST",
    "createWithoutCSVData": true,
    "files": [
        {
            "barcode": "yoyoyoyoy",
            "images": [
                { "imagePath": { "key": "assets/TEST/1234567890_front.jpg", "host": "metamodels-ai" } }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

###

### Create assets (mixed: one valid barcode, one without CSV — per-file success/failure)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/create HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "clientName": "TEST",
    "createWithoutCSVData": false,
    "files": [
        {
            "barcode": "8721222146063",
            "images": [
                { "imagePath": { "key": "NanoBanan/7d914d67-b99b-41e4-a28b-eb2f0a350fc9.jpg", "host": "metamodels-ai" } }
            ]
        },
        {
            "barcode": "no-csv-barcode",
            "images": [
                { "imagePath": { "key": "assets/TEST/1234567890_front.jpg", "host": "metamodels-ai" } }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

###

### Create assets with SKU properties (merges skuProperties into patternDict)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/createWithProperties HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "clientName": "TEST",
    "createWithoutCSVData": true,
    "files": [
        {
            "barcode": "8721222146063",
            "skuProperties": { "fabric": "cotton", "color": "blue" },
            "images": [
                { "imagePath": { "key": "NanoBanan/7d914d67-b99b-41e4-a28b-eb2f0a350fc9.jpg", "host": "metamodels-ai" } }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

###

### Create assets with SKU properties (no skuProperties — behaves like /create)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/createWithProperties HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "clientName": "TEST",
    "createWithoutCSVData": true,
    "files": [
        {
            "barcode": "8721222146063",
            "images": [
                { "imagePath": { "key": "assets/TEST/1234567890_front.jpg", "host": "metamodels-ai" } }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

###

### Search assets (clientName required; filter by any field or filter[] for patternDict keys)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/?clientName=BZT&pageNum=1&pageSize=20 HTTP/1.1

###

### Search assets with multi-value filter (e.g. fabric = velvet OR silk)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset?clientName=BZT&filter%5Bback_length%5D%5B0%5D=84+cm&filter%5Bback_length%5D%5B1%5D=124+cm&pageNum=1&pageSize=20

###

### Search assets by skuId
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/?clientName=TEST&skuId=6650a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0&pageNum=1&pageSize=20 HTTP/1.1

###

### Bulk update usage counter (increment by 1 for each asset)
PATCH http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/updateAssetUsageCounter HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "assetIds": ["69f30f083973e4c17bd3cc6e", "69f30f083973e4c17bd3cc6e"]
}

###

### Fuzzy text search (vector-ranked, top 200 SKUs)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset?clientName=BZT&fuzzy_text=red+cotton+shirt&isActive=true HTTP/1.1

###

### Fuzzy text + patternDict filter (intersection)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset?clientName=BZT&fuzzy_text=summer+dress&filter%5Bcolor%5D=red HTTP/1.1

###

### Fuzzy text, paginated
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/semanticSearch?clientName=BZT&fuzzy_text=ULTRA LIGHT GREY MELANGE&pageNum=2&pageSize=20 HTTP/1.1

###

### Fuzzy text via partner mirror route (identical behavior)
GET https://aistylingasset.flixstock.com/api/v1/asset/semanticSearchPartner?clientName=BZT&fuzzy_text=red+cotton+shirt HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: YW94M5m7SYZov3S8K1gLtrVKdr6nS8J6

###

### Partner mirror — paginated
GET https://aistylingasset.flixstock.com/api/v1/asset/semanticSearchPartner?clientName=BZT&fuzzy_text=ULTRA LIGHT GREY MELANGE&pageNum=2&pageSize=20 HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: YW94M5m7SYZov3S8K1gLtrVKdr6nS8J6

###

### Partner mirror — missing/invalid API key (401)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/semanticSearchPartner?clientName=BZT&fuzzy_text=red+cotton+shirt HTTP/1.1

###

### Search including internal (FLIXSTOCK) assets
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/?clientName=BZT&includeInternal=true&pageNum=1&pageSize=20 HTTP/1.1

###

### Fuzzy search including internal (FLIXSTOCK) assets
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset?clientName=BZT&includeInternal=true&fuzzy_text=red+cotton+shirt HTTP/1.1

###

### Multiselect on category (repeated key, OR-matched)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/?clientName=BZT&filter%5Bcategory%5D=tshirt&filter%5Bcategory%5D=shirt HTTP/1.1

###

### Multiselect via JSON-encoded array
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/?clientName=BZT&filter%5Bcategory%5D=%5B%22tshirt%22%2C%22shirt%22%5D HTTP/1.1

###

### Multiselect + fuzzy_text (pgvector path)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/?clientName=BZT&fuzzy_text=cotton&filter%5Bcategory%5D=tshirt&filter%5Bcategory%5D=shirt HTTP/1.1



### Internal asset upload URLs (new SKU, requires associatedTo)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/internalAssetUploadUrls HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "FLIXSTOCK",
  "associatedTo": "BZT",
  "files": [
    { "ext": ".jpg", "mimeType": "image/jpeg" }
  ]
}

### Internal asset upload URLs (missing associatedTo → 400)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/asset/internalAssetUploadUrls HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "FLIXSTOCK",
  "files": [
    { "ext": ".jpg" }
  ]
}
